Wanna play, wanna party, just wanna forget, crying feelings shiku-shiku chic-chic...

117
00:16:13,908 --> 00:16:19,888
頭と身体がバラバラ まだまだいける？抗っちゃう？ 強がり甲斐も パァになっちゃえば
Head and body are all over the place, can we still go on? Resist? Even the worth of acting tough goes poof!

118
00:16:20,128 --> 00:16:24,498
最初はグッドやる気満タン だけどチョっとつらいからだんだんダウン
At first it's good, full of motivation, but it gets a bit tough so step by step we down!

119
00:16:24,728 --> 00:16:27,788
上手いことパッと切り替えてこ 勝ちと負けであいこ それもご愛嬌？
Smoothly switching it up on the fly, win or lose ending in a tie, is that also part of the charm?

120
00:16:28,028 --> 00:16:32,428
最初はグッドやる気満タン だけどチョっとつらいからだんだんダウン
At first it's good, full of motivation, but it gets a bit tough so step by step we down!

121
00:16:32,678 --> 00:16:35,368
上手いことパッと切り替えなきゃ そう ダメダメ ダメダメ
If you don't smoothly switch it up on the fly, yeah, no-no, no-no!

122
00:16:35,628 --> 00:16:40,428
とんでもないことを望んでいるのだ ワクワクしながら走りたくて 笑いたい叶えたい あがっちゃうの止めないで
We're wishing for something outrageous, wanting to run while getting excited, wanting to laugh and make dreams come true, don't stop us from getting hyped!

123
00:16:45,028 --> 00:16:51,678
安い正解なんてポイポイ だっさい譲歩仕舞っちまえいえい
Toss away cheap correct answers, put away lame compromises, yeah!

124
00:16:52,028 --> 00:16:59,824
やっばいシュガーラッシュ はいゲッチュウ 夢中にさせて もっと もっと 音求メーション
Dangerous sugar rush, yes, getchu, make me obsessed, more and more sound-formation!

125
00:17:00,024 --> 00:17:06,524
変幻自在のドキドキが ピコーン！ズバーン！バキュン！でパラッパ ねえ もう一回
Chameleonic heartbeats go pikoon! zuban! bakyun! parappa, hey, once more!

126
00:17:06,824 --> 00:17:13,824
大シュガーラッシュ はいゲッチュウ 普通はよして もっと もっと 音オノマトペ
Mega sugar rush, yes, getchu, stop being ordinary, more and more sound onomatopoeia!

127
00:17:14,024 --> 00:17:20,824
全然足んないよ そんな数じゃ ピコーン！ズバーン！バキュン！でパラッパ ねえ もう一回
It's still not enough with just that amount, pikoon! zuban! bakyun! parappa, hey, once more!

128
00:17:21,024 --> 00:17:27,824
オゥ シュガーラッシュビートくれないと 化けて出ちゃう いいの？知らないよ？
Oh, if you don't give me the sugar rush beat, I'll turn into a monster, is that okay? Who knows!

129
00:17:34,024 --> 00:17:44,524
ピコーン！ズバーン！バキュン！でパラッパ ダメダメ ダメダメ No ダメダメ ダメダメ Oh yeah
Pikoon! Zuban! Bakyun! Parappa, no-no no-no, no no-no no-no, oh yeah!

130
00:18:19,324 --> 00:18:23,924
箱にあたる陽を横目で眺めて
Watching the sunlight hitting the box out of the corner of my eye...

131
00:18:24,224 --> 00:18:30,024
そっと陰る木の根に一人で比べてた
Comparing myself alone to the softly shadowing tree roots...

132
00:18:30,524 --> 00:18:35,524
積もる溜息を吹き払うように
As if blowing away the piled-up sighs,

133
00:18:35,824 --> 00:18:41,524
そんな私を君が見つけてくれたんだ
You were the one who found someone like me.

134
00:18:42,024 --> 00:18:47,824
そう それは恋のような ぬくもりを全部 君に笑顔咲かせたら
Yes, when all that warmth like love makes a smile blossom on you...

135
00:18:53,024 --> 00:19:00,024
桜風に踊る空 君と出会ったこの場所で
Dancing in the cherry blossom breeze sky, at this place where I met you,

136
00:19:00,324 --> 00:19:08,524
どれくらいの思い出ぎゅっと 溢れそうになるかな 君と流した涙は 明日の笑顔の糧にしよう
Wondering just how many memories will tightly overflow, let's turn the tears shed with you into nourishment for tomorrow's smiles!

137
00:19:10,024 --> 00:19:15,524
膝をついてたってほら 何度だっていいよ
Even if we fall to our knees, hey, any number of times is fine!

138
00:19:16,024 --> 00:19:21,524
意地を張って 恥をかいて いじけたって それでも
Stubbornly putting on airs, making fools of ourselves, sulking, even so...

139
00:19:21,824 --> 00:19:29,024
君が傍で見守ってくれたこと わかってるから
Because I know you've been watching over me right by my side.

140
00:19:39,024 --> 00:19:44,524
追い風を受けてとまらない日々も
Receiving a tailwind, even days that don't stop,

141
00:19:44,824 --> 00:19:49,824
そっと挫けそうになって心が渦巻いた
Gently starting to crumble, my heart swirling in turmoil...

142
00:19:50,024 --> 00:19:54,924
積もる溜息でまた泣きかけても
With piled-up sighs, even when about to cry again,

143
00:19:55,224 --> 00:19:59,924
あたたかな手でずっと支えてくれたんだ
You kept supporting me with warm hands the whole time.

144
00:20:00,070 --> 00:20:02,360
ほら 耳を澄ませば
Look, if you listen closely,

145
00:20:05,910 --> 00:20:10,060
一人じゃないから
You are not alone,

146
00:20:12,390 --> 00:20:16,930
諦めかけて心が閉じても
Even if you were about to give up and your heart closed,

147
00:22:19,032 --> 00:22:23,532
[Title: Capture the Moment]

148
00:22:29,863 --> 00:22:34,253
いつか描いた文字の中
Inside the words we once drew,

149
00:22:34,433 --> 00:22:40,433
目を閉じた先に 色づく景色が揺れた
colorful scenery wavered beyond closed eyes.

150
00:22:40,883 --> 00:22:44,783
少し戸惑う風の中
Amidst a slightly hesitant wind,

151
00:22:45,103 --> 00:22:51,133
重なる花びら 私たちの声
overlapping flower petals, our voices.

152
00:22:52,013 --> 00:22:57,093
一瞬一瞬 捕まえるみたいに
Like capturing every single moment,

153
00:22:57,293 --> 00:23:01,343
もっともっと踏み出せたら
if we could step forward just a bit more...

154
00:23:01,913 --> 00:23:05,443
[we are one]

155
00:23:06,213 --> 00:23:10,543
あの涙が今の僕らを繋げて
Those tears connect us right now,

156
00:23:11,193 --> 00:23:16,173
この心に君のカケラがいるから
because a piece of you resides in this heart.

157
00:23:16,813 --> 00:23:22,123
強くなくてもいい 今の光を
It's okay if we aren't strong; releasing this current light

158
00:23:22,283 --> 00:23:27,593
僕と君と集め空に放つ
into the open sky together with you.

159
00:23:27,823 --> 00:23:34,473
この奇跡を僕らでそっと輝かせるから
We will gently make this miracle shine ourselves,

160
00:23:34,643 --> 00:23:39,143
力が湧くから
because strength wells up from within.

161
00:23:43,713 --> 00:23:47,413
新たな種を握りしめ
Clenching new seeds in our hands,

162
00:23:47,813 --> 00:23:53,333
遠い未来へと強く願い込め撒いた
we sowed them with strong wishes toward a distant future.

163
00:23:53,973 --> 00:23:58,773
希望の風を吹かせては
Letting the winds of hope blow forth,

164
00:23:59,133 --> 00:24:05,053
理想の花びら 祈る明日の空
Petals of ideals, praying for tomorrow's sky.

165
00:24:05,643 --> 00:24:11,023
何百億も 光る星みたいに
Like hundreds of millions of shining stars,

166
00:24:11,193 --> 00:24:15,853
ずっと ずっと終わらないから
it will last forever and ever, never ending.

167
00:24:16,623 --> 00:24:22,213
この笑顔が過去を強く抱きしめて
This smile strongly embraces the past,

168
00:24:22,463 --> 00:24:27,603
今未来に この手伸ばしてゆくから
stretching out these hands toward the future now.

169
00:24:29,013 --> 00:24:33,483
時に転んでも 空を見上げよう
Even if we stumble sometimes, let's look up at the sky.

170
00:24:34,213 --> 00:24:39,413
笑い日々を刻んでゆく
Carving out smiling days as we go.

171
00:24:39,763 --> 00:24:45,343
次の夢を掴み取るって約束するから
I promise we will grasp our next dream,

172
00:24:45,773 --> 00:24:50,353
踏み出そうここから
so let's step forward from right here.

173
00:25:00,080 --> 00:25:04,540
(We are with you) (We are with you)

174
00:25:05,140 --> 00:25:09,540
(We are with you) (We are with you)

175
00:25:10,090 --> 00:25:12,790
同じ未来を見ていたい
I want to see the same future with you

176
00:25:13,040 --> 00:25:15,590
あの夢手にしたい
I want that dream in my hands

177
00:25:16,240 --> 00:25:21,840
(We are with you, capture the moment)

178
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:25,840
触れた奇跡の中で
Within the miracle we touched

179
00:25:27,840 --> 00:25:32,540
その先まで続く空にまぎれたら
If we get lost in the sky stretching beyond

180
00:25:33,540 --> 00:25:37,840
君の場所と今を繋げたくて
Wanting to connect where you are with right now

181
00:25:39,140 --> 00:25:44,540
あの涙が今の僕らを繋げて
Those tears connect us as we are now

182
00:25:45,040 --> 00:25:49,840
この心に君のカケラがいるから
Because a piece of you is in this heart

183
00:25:50,540 --> 00:25:53,540
強くなくてもいい
It's okay even if we aren't strong

184
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:59,840
今の光を僕と（君と）集め空に放つ
Gathering this light with you and me, releasing it into the sky

185
00:26:01,540 --> 00:26:07,540
この奇跡を僕らでそっと輝かせるから
Because we will gently make this miracle shine together

186
00:26:08,040 --> 00:26:12,040
（その手で）咲かせようここから
Let's make it bloom from here

187
00:26:13,540 --> 00:26:17,040
一人じゃないから
Because we're not alone

188
00:26:18,040 --> 00:26:21,040
(we are one)

189
00:26:44,540 --> 00:26:49,040
[Title: 褪せたハナミドリ]
[Title: Faded Green]

190
00:26:53,040 --> 00:27:01,240
恋に恋してるあの子が
That girl who's in love with being in love

191
00:27:02,040 --> 00:27:11,040
口ずさんだ流行りの歌
Hummed a popular song she heard somewhere

192
00:27:12,040 --> 00:27:18,240
反吐が出る位甘い世迷言で
With cloying, vomit-inducing sweet nonsense

193
00:27:19,040 --> 00:27:23,840
包まれたケミカルなお菓子みたい Ah, ah
Like a packaged chemical sweet, Ah, ah

194
00:27:24,040 --> 00:27:27,540
気付いて 永遠の愛なんて
Realize that eternal love

195
00:27:28,040 --> 00:27:31,840
建前 何所にもありはしない 信じたいけど
Is merely a facade nowhere to be found, even if I want to believe

196
00:27:32,540 --> 00:27:37,840
どうせ 叶わぬ約束 ラブソングなんて嫌いだ
Anyway, I hate love songs and unfulfillable promises

197
00:27:38,040 --> 00:27:42,840
ただ綺麗な言葉は要らない
I don't need purely pretty words

198
00:27:43,040 --> 00:27:50,040
未来永劫訪れ無いセカイなら その手でいっそ止めて
If this is a world that will never see eternity, stop it with your own hands

199
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:10,040
枯れた想い出に 浮かぶハナミドリ
A dogwood floating in withered memories

200
00:28:10,540 --> 00:28:19,040
二人肩並べ歩いた目黒通りの桜 “いつまでもずっとこのままで居ようね” 囁いた声も瞞し
The cherry blossoms on Meguro Avenue where we walked side by side, even the voice whispering "Let's stay like this forever" was a deception

201
00:28:20,040 --> 00:28:25,040
もーいっそ 不埒な街を彷徨って
Instead, wandering through a lawless town

202
00:28:25,540 --> 00:28:30,540
注がれた安酒に酔って 身を委ねちゃおうか
Getting drunk on poured cheap liquor, shall I surrender myself?

203
00:28:31,040 --> 00:28:35,540
私だって 寂しいんだもの 素敵な罪を重ねても 貴方は振り返りはしない
After all, I'm lonely too; even if we pile up wonderful sins, you won't look back

204
00:28:36,040 --> 00:28:40,540
分かってるけど
Even though I know that...

205
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:45,540
どうせ 果たせぬ結実 ラブソングなんて嫌いだ
After all, I hate unfulfillable fruit and love songs

206
00:28:46,040 --> 00:28:50,540
あんなに「好き」を重ねていたって
Even though we piled up so much "love"

207
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:57,540
今じゃもう何事も無かったかの様に 崩れてしまうなんて
How could it crumble away as if nothing ever happened now?

208
00:29:20,040 --> 00:29:29,040
さよなら純情もう戻れないや そんだけ大きな恋をしたんだ
Goodbye innocence, we can never go back; that's how huge of a love I fell into

209
00:29:30,040 --> 00:29:36,540
すべてが空っぽの嘘に見えても 愛を探してゆく
Even if everything looks like empty lies, I'll keep searching for love

210
00:29:37,040 --> 00:29:46,040
叶わぬ約束 ラブソングなんて嫌いだ ただ綺麗な言葉は要らない
Unfulfillable promises, I hate love songs; I don't need purely pretty words

211
00:29:47,040 --> 00:29:54,040
未来永劫訪れ無いセカイなら その手でいっそ止めて
If this is a world that will never see eternity, stop it with your own hands

212
00:30:26,449 --> 00:30:32,469
ひらりふらり 彷徨ってく 白い夢は もうやめた
Fluttering and wandering aimlessly, I've already given up on white dreams

213
00:30:33,309 --> 00:30:40,069
私 ずっと 知ってたの 匂いに 誘われて 墜ちてく
I'd known all along, lured by the scent as I fall

214
00:30:47,089 --> 00:30:54,029
与えられた 役名を 尋ねることが 怖くて
It's terrifying to ask about the role I was given

215
00:30:54,449 --> 00:31:00,789
流れる日々の 答えに 濁したのは 心だけ
Only my heart was muddied by the answers of passing days

216
00:31:04,149 --> 00:31:07,849
定められた 箱の中 味気のない日常に
Within the designated box, in a dull everyday life

217
00:31:08,249 --> 00:31:14,699
少し 愛おしくしてたのか 漂ううちも 知らぬまま
Did I grow a bit fond of it? Without even realizing as I drifted

218
00:31:22,299 --> 00:31:29,049
しまい隠したはずだった ただのざれ事 分かってる
I had hidden it away, knowing it was just idle chatter

219
00:31:31,999 --> 00:31:35,899
奥に 歪む その目で見た 紛れもない 衝動
The undeniable impulse I saw with those distorted eyes deep inside

220
00:31:36,259 --> 00:31:42,549
ひらりゆらり 飛んでゆける 迷い惑い 閉じ込めた
Fluttering and swaying as I fly, trapping my wavering confusions

221
00:31:43,149 --> 00:31:49,999
あなたは もう 離さないで やがて 嘘と 散っても
Please don't let go of me anymore, even if we eventually scatter into lies

222
00:31:52,999 --> 00:31:59,999
ひらりふらり 彷徨ってく 白い夢は もうやめた
Fluttering and wandering aimlessly, I've already given up on white dreams

223
00:32:00,099 --> 00:32:03,999
私 ずっと 知ってたの 匂いに 誘われて 墜ちてく
Even though I'd known all along, lured by the scent as I fall

224
00:32:18,099 --> 00:32:24,499
纏わり付く 言葉だけ 何の意味もないくせに
Clinging words carry no meaning at all, yet

225
00:32:24,999 --> 00:32:31,999
背負わされてる 重さに 潰れそうでもがいてた
I was struggling, nearly crushed by the weight I was forced to carry

226
00:32:32,399 --> 00:32:39,199
気付かない ふりをしていたのは 全ては 囁いた
I pretended not to notice as everything whispered

227
00:32:39,899 --> 00:32:48,399
闇に 染まる 覚悟と 甘さの 代償は それだけ ひらりゆらり 舞い降りてく
That alone is the price of sweetness and the resolve to be dyed in darkness, fluttering and swaying down

228
00:32:49,299 --> 00:32:59,999
迷い惑い 脱ぎ捨てて あなたは もう 離さないで やがて 嘘と 散っても
Shedding my wavering confusions, please don't let go of me anymore, even if we eventually scatter into lies

229
00:33:03,099 --> 00:33:06,599
ひらりゆらり 落とされてく 白い夢は もうやめた
Fluttering and swaying, being dropped down, I've already given up on white dreams

230
00:33:06,999 --> 00:33:12,699
私 きっと 戻れない 匂いに 誘われて 墜ちてく
I'm sure I can't go back, lured by the scent as I fall

231
00:33:13,299 --> 00:33:20,199
ひらりゆらり 飛んでゆける 迷い惑い 閉じ込めた
Fluttering and swaying as I fly, trapping my wavering confusions

232
00:33:20,599 --> 00:33:27,599
あなたは もう 離さないで やがて 嘘と 散っても
Please don't let go of me anymore, even if we eventually scatter into lies

233
00:33:27,999 --> 00:33:33,999
ひらりふらり 彷徨ってく 白い夢は もうやめた
Fluttering and wandering aimlessly, I've already given up on white dreams

234
00:33:34,299 --> 00:33:40,999
私 ずっと 知ってたの 匂いに 誘われて 墜ちてく
I'd known all along, lured by the scent as I fall

235
00:33:51,999 --> 00:34:01,599
ひらりふらり 彷徨ってく 白い夢は もうやめた 私 ずっと 知ってたの
Fluttering and wandering aimlessly, I've already given up on white dreams, I'd known all along

236
00:34:21,099 --> 00:34:25,599
息をしている
I am breathing

237
00:34:25,999 --> 00:34:31,999
だから 生きている 何度も ずっと 言葉を 尽くしてきたんだ
That's why I'm alive; time and time again, I've poured all my words into it

238
00:34:32,099 --> 00:34:36,599
息をしている ように 見えている
It looks as though I'm breathing

239
00:34:36,999 --> 00:34:41,999
青が 染み出す 私に とっての 何か
Something that bleeds blue for me

240
00:34:43,999 --> 00:34:47,599
鼓動が ドクドクしている
My heartbeat is pounding away

241
00:34:48,999 --> 00:34:54,599
此処は いつも 変わらずに 急かし続ける
Here, without ever changing, it keeps rushing me on

242
00:34:55,299 --> 00:35:00,099
ボタン一つのいのち
A life of a single button

243
00:35:00,112 --> 00:35:09,212
大丈夫 ずっと私は 歌い続けるから
It's okay, I'll keep on singing forever...

244
00:37:18,476 --> 00:37:27,816
大丈夫 ずっと私は 歌い続けるから
It's okay, I'll keep on singing forever...

245
00:37:33,476 --> 00:37:43,136
最後まで私も生きているかわからないけど 君がくれた言葉は確かに残ってる
I don't know if I'll even be alive until the very end, but the words you gave me are definitely still here.

246
00:37:44,256 --> 00:37:54,056
最後まで私を覚えていなくてもいいから いつ死んでしまうだろう わかんない わかんないよ
Even if you don't remember me in the end—wondering when I might die, I don't know, I really don't know.

247
00:37:54,256 --> 00:37:59,856
今、君が笑えたこと それだけで意味があること
The fact that you smiled right now, that alone gives it meaning.

248
00:38:00,056 --> 00:38:05,556
君が忘れちゃっても私は死なないから
Even if you forget me, I won't die.

249
00:38:05,756 --> 00:38:13,176
いのちのような夢を見てるよ またね バイバイ
I'm dreaming a dream like life. See you later, bye-bye.

250
00:39:06,256 --> 00:39:13,256
ここに宣言します セブンスホイッスル
I hereby declare: The Seventh Whistle.

251
00:39:14,856 --> 00:39:22,056
[Title: ラッキーセブンスホイッスル]
[Title: Lucky Seventh Whistle]

252
00:39:33,456 --> 00:39:40,256
1つ 病める時も 健やかなる時もずっと 愛を歌い続けること
First: whether in sickness or in health, to keep on singing of love forevermore—

253
00:39:40,556 --> 00:39:47,856
堂々と誓います 2つ トークだとかダンスも もっと追求します
I proudly swear it. Second: I'll pursue my talking and dancing even further.

254
00:39:48,056 --> 00:39:59,056
3つ ずっと推してもらえる アイドルになってみせます
Third: to become an idol whom you'll keep supporting forevermore.

255
00:40:00,604 --> 00:40:02,404
アイドルになってみせます
I'll show you I can become an idol!

256
00:40:03,204 --> 00:40:07,504
4つ目 不安な未来も私が照らすんだ
Look closely, I'll illuminate even an uncertain future!

257
00:40:07,904 --> 00:40:11,804
それでも落ち込んじゃう日は
Even so, on days when I feel down,

258
00:40:14,904 --> 00:40:20,504
思い出しているよ みんなのその笑顔 その声
I remember everyone's smiles and voices...

259
00:40:23,104 --> 00:40:30,404
ハッピーラッキーセブン革命 サンデイマンデイこの先ずっと 一緒だよね 約束
Happy Lucky Seven Revolution! Sunday, Monday, we'll be together forever—it's a promise.

260
00:40:33,504 --> 00:40:38,304
ほらね、笑う門にソラ来る
See? Sora comes to those who laugh!

261
00:40:38,904 --> 00:40:45,404
ハッピーバースデイ毎日がほら チューズデイウェンズデイラッキーデイ
Happy Birthday, every day is a Tuesday, Wednesday, Lucky Day!

262
00:40:45,904 --> 00:40:54,804
生まれ変わっても迷わずに 君だけのアイドルになるよ
Even if I'm reborn, without hesitating, I'll become your one and only idol!

263
