おっかしいね おっかしいね くっだらないね Ya ya
Ain't it funny? Ain't it silly? How trivial, ya ya.

311
00:47:41,072 --> 00:47:44,572
ワケないね ワケないね ハイスペックなんで
No way, no way, 'cause I'm high-spec.

312
00:47:44,572 --> 00:47:49,572
最先端のPON やらなきゃ損 ドキドキが止まりそ ネジ巻いて
State-of-the-art PON, gotta do it or it's a loss, my heart's about to stop, wind the screw!

313
00:47:49,872 --> 00:47:55,572
リルビ なんてゆーかエブリデイ ネジ巻いて ネジ巻いてよ
Lilbi... how should I say, everyday, wind the screw, wind the screw!

314
00:47:55,572 --> 00:48:02,072
ちょっとだけね ちょ ちょ ちょっとだけね ピボパボ鳴らして夢を製造る
Just a little bit, cho-cho-just a little bit, making pipopapo sounds to manufacture dreams.

315
00:48:02,072 --> 00:48:09,572
でもちょっとだけじゃそのうち足んなくなるかも
But just a little bit might not be enough soon.

316
00:48:09,572 --> 00:48:15,072
リルビ リルビ リルビ リルビ リルビ リルビ リルビモ
Lilbi, Lilbi, Lilbi, Lilbi, Lilbi, Lilbi, Lilbimo!

317
00:48:15,072 --> 00:48:22,072
Tick tick tick tick tick tock tock リルビ リルビ リルビ リルビ
Tick tick tick tick tick tock tock, Lilbi, Lilbi, Lilbi, Lilbi...

318
00:48:23,572 --> 00:48:26,572
わんつーで参拝 みこ みこ みこ！
One, two, visiting the shrine! Miko, miko, miko!

