君の配信に 僕は夢中になった
I became obsessed with your streams

358
00:51:13,052 --> 00:51:15,732
画面の中の君が 僕を救ってくれた
You inside the screen saved me

359
00:51:16,032 --> 00:51:18,742
いつか画面の外へいなくてなっても
Even if one day you're no longer outside the screen

360
00:51:18,992 --> 00:51:21,732
画面の中にいた君のことを
The you who was inside the screen

361
00:51:22,002 --> 00:51:25,482
君自身が好きでいてくれてたら 嬉しいな
I'd be so happy if you loved yourself too

362
00:51:25,832 --> 00:51:31,080
僕は幸せだ
I am happy

363
00:51:31,330 --> 00:51:34,230
あの黄昏も 折り畳めば静寂
Even that twilight, when folded up, is silence

364
00:51:34,430 --> 00:51:37,230
僕らの街じゃ 暗がりは合図だ
In our town, the darkness is a signal

365
00:51:37,430 --> 00:51:40,230
灯を消して はじめよう 幕よ開け
Put out the lights, let's begin, raise the curtain

366
00:51:40,430 --> 00:51:43,230
見上げ願いを あなたのように
Looking up, placing my wish just like you

367
00:51:43,430 --> 00:51:46,230
変わらず在っていたい
I want to stay unchanged

368
00:51:46,430 --> 00:51:49,230
きらめきのヴェールを
A veil of shimmering light

369
00:51:49,430 --> 00:51:52,230
目元に箒星 描いて
Drawing a shooting star across my eyes

370
00:51:52,430 --> 00:51:55,230
瞬いた ソワレ 今だ
Twinkling Soiree, now's the time!

371
00:51:55,430 --> 00:51:58,230
寝息を立てる太陽の目を盗んで
Stealing past the sleeping sun's gaze

372
00:51:58,430 --> 00:52:01,230
大脱走さ 逃げ出そうぜ
It's a grand breakout, let's run away

373
00:52:01,430 --> 00:52:04,230
朝未き空を跨ぐ 栞を挟んだら
Straddling the dawning sky, once we bookmark it

374
00:52:04,430 --> 00:52:07,230
行かなくちゃ ソワレ
We must go, Soiree

375
00:52:07,430 --> 00:52:10,230
夜が明けるまでさ
Until the night breaks

376
00:52:10,430 --> 00:52:13,230
もうすこし このままで
Just a little longer, like this

377
00:52:13,430 --> 00:52:16,230
あの鐘の音は 茜差したって止まない
That bell ring doesn't stop even as the madder red shines

378
00:52:16,430 --> 00:52:19,230
時間だ 集まろう 野望に喝采 エールを
It's time, let's gather, cheering on our ambitions

379
00:52:19,430 --> 00:52:22,230
約束だ ソワレ 僕が眠るまでは
It's a promise, Soiree, until I fall asleep

380
00:52:22,430 --> 00:52:25,980
何度でも また明日
No matter how many times, see you tomorrow

381
00:52:29,580 --> 00:52:35,080
We're gonna step and go...

382
00:52:44,280 --> 00:52:47,580
いつも通り仲間達と過ごした季節重ねてた
Reliving the seasons spent just like always with friends

383
00:52:47,780 --> 00:52:51,080
きらめくように光る僕らの日々は胸でときめく
Our sparkling days make my chest throb with excitement

384
00:52:51,280 --> 00:52:54,580
どんな未来が来ても どんなに離れていても
No matter what future comes, no matter how far apart we are

385
00:52:59,580 --> 00:53:03,080
僕ら交わした声 消えない
The voices we exchanged will never fade

386
00:53:03,580 --> 00:53:07,580
We're gonna step and go to brand new story
We're gonna step and go to a brand new story

387
00:53:15,580 --> 00:53:22,080
夜を通り抜けて Rolling Rolling on
Passing through the night, rolling, rolling on

388
00:53:22,580 --> 00:53:25,580
I'm gonna go there with my memories

389
00:53:25,880 --> 00:53:30,080
世界はまるで 永遠への Escape
The world is like an escape to eternity

390
00:53:31,080 --> 00:53:37,080
愛しさ溢れて光キラリ願い いつまでも消えない輝き両手に
Filled with affection, sparkling light, wishes and everlasting radiance in both hands

391
00:53:37,580 --> 00:53:44,080
優しさ集めて光キラリ築く時間をずっと 果てしなく歩んでいく
Gathering kindness, sparkling light, building moments to walk endlessly

392
00:53:45,080 --> 00:53:52,080
いつも通り歩く見慣れた景色どこかぎこちない
Walking familiar sights just like always, feeling slightly awkward

393
00:53:53,080 --> 00:53:56,580
廻りだした世界 次のステージ始まったばかり
The world has started spinning, the next stage has only just begun

394
00:53:56,880 --> 00:54:22,080
どれだけ手を伸ばせば 僕ら夢に届くかな
How far do we need to reach out our hands to touch our dreams?

395
00:55:56,624 --> 00:56:02,224
お別れしたのはもっと前の事だったような
It felt like we said our goodbyes a long time ago...

396
00:56:03,294 --> 00:56:10,244
悲しい光は封じ込めて踵すり減らしたんだ
I bottled up the sorrowful light and wore my heels down.

397
00:56:10,964 --> 00:56:17,524
君といた時は見えた 今は見えなくなった
Back when I was with you, I could see it, but now I can't see it anymore.

398
00:56:17,864 --> 00:56:21,934
透明な彗星をぼんやりと
Vaguely gazing at the transparent comet...

399
00:56:22,074 --> 00:56:25,054
でもそれだけ探している
Yet that's all I keep searching for.

400
00:56:25,384 --> 00:56:31,874
しょっちゅう唄を歌ったよ その時だけのメロディーを
I sang songs all the time, singing melodies meant only for that moment.

401
00:56:32,154 --> 00:56:39,904
寂しくなんかなかったよ ちゃんと寂しくなれたから
I wasn't lonely at all... because I was able to truly feel lonely.

402
00:56:40,044 --> 00:56:46,894
いつまでどこまでなんて 正常か異常かなんて
Wondering until when or how far, wondering if it's normal or abnormal...

403
00:56:47,104 --> 00:56:54,044
考える暇も無いほど 歩くのは大変だ
There's not even time to think about it; just walking forward is hard enough.

404
00:56:54,154 --> 00:57:01,414
楽しい方がずっといいよ ごまかして笑っていくよ
It's always better to have fun, brushing it off with a smile as I go.

405
00:57:01,584 --> 00:57:08,604
大丈夫だ あの痛みは 忘れたって消えやしない
It's alright, that pain may be forgotten, but it will never fade away.

406
00:57:09,394 --> 00:57:15,994
理想で作った道を 現実が塗り替えていくよ
Reality is painting over the path built by ideals.

407
00:57:16,124 --> 00:57:23,354
思い出はその軌跡の上で 輝きになって残っている
Memories remain shining upon those very traces.

408
00:57:23,724 --> 00:57:30,494
お別れしたのは何で 何のためだったんだろうな
Why did we say goodbye? What was it all for, I wonder?

409
00:57:30,794 --> 00:57:37,494
悲しい光が僕の影を 前に長く伸ばしている
The sorrowful light stretches my shadow far out ahead.

410
00:57:37,674 --> 00:57:44,844
時々熱が出るよ 時間がある時眠るよ
Sometimes I get a fever, and I sleep whenever I have time.

411
00:57:45,064 --> 00:57:52,414
夢だと解るその中で 君と会ってからまた行こう
Realizing it's a dream, after meeting you there, let's go again.

412
00:57:52,634 --> 00:57:59,784
晴天とはほど遠い 終わらない暗闇にも
Even in the endless darkness, so far from clear skies,

413
00:57:59,894 --> 00:58:07,004
星を思い浮かべたなら すぐ銀河の中だ
if you picture the stars in your mind, you're right inside the galaxy.

414
00:58:07,224 --> 00:58:14,424
あまり泣かなくなっても 靴を新しくしても
Even if I cry less often, even if I get a new pair of shoes,

415
00:58:14,574 --> 00:58:21,914
大丈夫だ あの痛みは 忘れたって消えやしない
It's alright, that pain may be forgotten, but it will never fade away.

416
00:58:22,054 --> 00:58:29,114
伝えたかった事が きっとあったんだろうな
There must have been things I truly wanted to tell you.

417
00:58:29,224 --> 00:58:36,304
恐らくありきたりなんだろうけど こんなにも
It's probably just cliché, but even so...

418
00:58:50,604 --> 00:58:57,564
お別れした事は 出会った事と繋がっている
Saying goodbye is connected to having met in the first place.

419
00:58:57,814 --> 00:59:04,694
あの透明な彗星は 透明だから無くならない
That transparent comet will never disappear because it is transparent.

420
00:59:05,084 --> 00:59:12,274
○×△どれかなんて 皆と比べてどうかなんて
Wondering whether it's right, wrong, or whatever, wondering how it compares to everyone else...

421
00:59:12,444 --> 00:59:19,554
確かめる間も無い程 生きるのは最高だ
There's not even time to check; living is just the best.

422
00:59:19,764 --> 00:59:26,784
あまり泣かなくなっても ごまかして笑っていくよ
Even if I cry less often, I'll brush it off and keep smiling as I go.

423
00:59:26,944 --> 00:59:34,114
大丈夫だ あの痛みは 忘れたって消えやしない
It's alright, that pain may be forgotten, but it will never fade away.

424
00:59:34,284 --> 00:59:44,844
大丈夫だ この光の始まりには 君がいる
It's alright, at the very beginning of this light... you are there.

425
01:00:22,596 --> 01:00:31,596
Ray of Jewelry

426
01:00:38,886 --> 01:00:46,566
みんな、0期生ライブを見てくれてありがとう！さっそくですが、告知のお時間です。まずは、こちら！
Thank you everyone for watching the 0th Generation live! Without further ado, it's announcement time. First up, right here!

427
01:00:47,426 --> 01:00:52,566
0期生ライブ記念グッズが出ます！イェーイ！
The 0th Generation live commemorative merch is coming out! Yay!

428
01:00:53,126 --> 01:00:56,646
それでは順番に紹介していくね。1つ目は、こちら！
Now let's introduce them one by one. The first one is right here!

429
01:00:57,066 --> 01:01:05,986
アクリルスタンド！トビ先生が描いてくれました。みんなの分があるので、ぜひ全部集めてください！
Acrylic stands! Tobi-sensei drew them for us. There's one for everyone, so please collect them all!

430
01:01:06,406 --> 01:01:22,546
次は、ロボ子紹介お願い！はーい！こちらはガーランド風キーホルダー！ガーランドをイメージしたアクリルチャームです。それぞれをつなげて飾ることができるので、0期生みんなつなげてってね！
Next, Roboco-san, introduction please! Coming! This is the garland-style keychain! It's an acrylic charm inspired by a garland. You can connect them all together to display them, so be sure to link all 0th Gen members together!

431
01:01:23,106 --> 01:01:39,186
次はみこっち！はーい！次はネックストラップ付きチケットケースです。イベントのチケットなど入れられるネックストラップ付きのチケットケースです。背景台紙付きで、ケースの中にアクリルスタンドを入れて持ち運んでね！
Next is Mikochi! Coming! Next is the ticket case with neck strap. It's a ticket case with a neck strap where you can put event tickets and more. It comes with a background backing card, so put your acrylic stand inside the case and carry it around!

432
01:01:39,906 --> 01:01:52,706
次は、スイちゃん！はい、次はランダム缶バッジ！華やかなデザインの缶バッジになっております。全10種のランダム仕様になっているので、ぜひたくさん集めてください！次はあずちゃん！
Next is Sui-chan! Yes, next is the random tin badge! These are tin badges with gorgeous designs. Since there are 10 random types in total, please collect lots of them! Next is Azu-chan!

433
01:01:52,886 --> 01:02:08,606
はい、次はブランケット！今回の記念キービジュアルを大きく使用したブランケットになっております。冬のお供にいかがでしょうか？ということで、そらちゃんにお返しします！はい、みんなありがとう！まだまだありますよ！
Yes, next is the blanket! This blanket prominently features our commemorative key visual. How about it as a companion for the winter? And with that, I'll pass it back to Sora-chan! Yes, thank you everyone! There's still more!

434
01:02:08,886 --> 01:02:24,466
ブロマイドケース！0期生を応援してくれてるファンのみんなへ、0期生全員からのメッセージ入りのブロマイドケースだよ！メッセージは届いてからのお楽しみ！内容は複製になるのでお気を付けください。
Bromide case! For all the fans supporting the 0th Generation, it's a bromide case featuring messages from all 0th Gen members! The messages are a surprise until they arrive! Please note that the messages will be duplicated prints.

435
01:02:25,166 --> 01:02:37,846
はい、というわけでグッズは以上になります！もりだくさんだったね！今回は受注限定やセット販売はないので、好きなものを単品でたくさんお買い求めください！
Yes, and that concludes the merchandise! There was a lot, wasn't there? This time there are no order-limited sets or bundled sales, so please purchase your favorites individually and in quantity!

436
01:02:38,406 --> 01:02:53,466
ここからはそれぞれ告知をさせていただきます！まずは私、ときのそらから！先ほどの私の7周年記念配信でも言いますが、ときのそら7周年記念グッズもありますのでよろしくお願いします！
From here on, each of us will make our announcements! First is me, Tokino Sora! As I mentioned in my 7th anniversary stream earlier, there are also Tokino Sora 7th anniversary goods, so please check them out!

437
01:02:54,586 --> 01:03:25,426
そして！私、ときのそらのニューシングル「おかえりなさい」が9月11日にリリースになります！テレビアニメ「僕の妻は感情がない」オープニング主題歌として現在オンエア中です！そしてそしてそして、本日解禁になりました「ラッキーセブンスホイッスル」もシングルに収録されます！こちらは7周年記念ソングとして制作しました！どちらもメモリアルな楽曲になっているので、いっぱい聞いてください！次はおづきっち…あずきち！
And! My, Tokino Sora's new single "Okaerinasai" will be released on September 11! It is currently airing as the opening theme song for the TV anime "My Wife Has No Emotion"! And and and, "Lucky Seventh Whistle," which was unveiled today, will also be included in the single! This was produced as a 7th anniversary song! Both are memorial songs, so please listen to them a lot! Next is Azuki... Azu-kichi!

438
01:03:29,226 --> 01:03:47,426
はい、AZKiです！AZKiからは、AZKiメジャーデビューライブ「声音エントロピー」追加公演9月17日、18日豊洲PITにて開催しますのでぜひよろしくお願いします！そして現在、アルバム「Route If」が配信中＆発売中です！ぜひこちらもよろしくお願いします！次はみこっち！
Yes, I'm AZKi! From AZKi, we're holding additional shows for the AZKi Major Debut LIVE "Koe no Entropy" on September 17 and 18 at Toyosu PIT, so please check it out! Also, my major 1st album "Route If" is currently streaming and on sale! Please check that out too! Next is Mikochi!

439
01:03:49,126 --> 01:04:05,226
はい、みこからは2024年10月26日土曜日に、さくらみこファーストソロライブ「flower fantasista!」開催決定です！二次先行受付がなんと明日23時59分までです！お忘れなきように！
Yes, from Miko, it has been decided that Sakura Miko's 1st Solo Live "flower fantasista!" will be held on Saturday, October 26, 2024! The secondary advance ticket lottery is open until tomorrow at 23:59! Don't forget!

440
01:04:05,826 --> 01:04:17,606
そして、2024年9月25日にファーストアルバム「flower rhapsody」が発売決定しております！各店舗にてまだまだ予約受付中です！よろしくね！それではスイちゃん！
And, my 1st album "flower rhapsody" is scheduled for release on September 25, 2024! Reservations are still being accepted at various stores! Please check it out! Now, Sui-chan!

441
01:04:20,126 --> 01:04:45,486
はい！星街すいせいライブツアー2024「Spectra of Nova」の情報が解禁されました！さいたまスーパーアリーナ、マリンメッセアリーナ、サンパレスホテルホールで11月14日から12月28日でツアーが開催されます！月イチチケットの一時抽選も始まっているのでぜひみんな応募してください！詳細はツアー特設サイトを見てね！
Yes! Information for Hoshimachi Suisei Live Tour 2024 "Spectra of Nova" has been unveiled! The tour will be held from November 14 to December 28 at Saitama Super Arena, Marine Messe Fukuoka, and Sun Palace Hotel Hall! Ticket lotteries are also underway, so everyone please apply! Check the tour special site for details!

442
01:04:46,166 --> 01:04:56,986
では最後にろーじ！はい！えっと、僕個人はないので、僕たちのチャンネル登録もぜひよろしくお願いします！
Now finally, Roboco! Yes! Um, since I don't have a personal announcement, please be sure to subscribe to our channels!

443
01:05:00,228 --> 01:05:06,248
えーっと！9月5日から10月2日の2日まで、極楽湯コラボも開催中です！いえーい！
Umm! From September 5th to October 2nd, the Gokurakuyu collaboration is also being held! Yay!

444
01:05:10,158 --> 01:05:14,718
みんな僕たち0期生のユニ、つかりに来てください！
Everyone, come soak in our 0th-generation... collab baths!

445
01:05:16,248 --> 01:05:20,768
それでは、これからも0期生をよろしくお願いします！
And now, we hope you'll continue to support the 0th Generation!

